## Configuration

Add to your `epack.yaml`:

```yaml
collectors:
  {{.Name}}:
    source: OWNER/{{.BinaryName}}@v1
    config:
      organization: your-org
    secrets:
      - {{.TokenEnv}}
```

## Options

| Option | Type | Required | Description |
|--------|------|----------|-------------|
| `organization` | string | Yes | The organization to collect from |
| `level` | string | No | `trust` (the default), `audit`, or `internal`. `internal` adds the list of users. |

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `{{.TokenEnv}}` | TODO: The API token, and the permissions it needs |
